{"text": "65_QLED_Q8F_4K_Samsung_Vision_AI_Smart_TV_(2025).md 2026-05-22 Available technology, functions and features may vary by country, service provider, network environment or product, and are subject to change without notice. Requires a Wi-Fi, Bluetooth or other wireless network connection and login to Samsung account. Connected devices are sold separately. Use of calm technology requires agreement to privacy notices from both SmartThings and the auto-registered device. TV and mobile device must be connected to SmartThings to use 3D Map View function. UI is subject to change without prior notice. Gestures to control with your watch (Universal Gestures) Easily control your TV with your smartwatch. Just wear your Galaxy Watch and use hand gestures, like pinching to select an option, or moving your wrist back and forth for pause and play. Available apps and services may vary and are subject to change without notice. Only supported on Galaxy Watch4 and later models, and Wear OS 5 and higher versions. Save energy with intelligent analysis (AI Energy Mode) Energy saving made easy with SmartThings. By turning on AI Energy Mode, it auto detects surrounding light levels and analyzes usage behaviors to adjust the brightness. Also, it analyzes the content scene-by-scene to subtly adjust brightness where possible, to manage energy consumption. Energy saving rate may vary by region, model, size, viewing conditions and type of content. Products shipped in Eco Mode have some AI Energy Mode", "source": "d:\\SEMESTER 4\\AI Final Project\\Multi-Agent-RAG\\data\\65_QLED_Q8F_4K_Samsung_Vision_AI_Smart_TV_(2025).pdf", "page": 3}